            "title": "Question: Minimum",
            "id": 82907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co to wyświetla w konsoli? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"coordinates = [\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(coordinates))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nic, ponieważ wszystkie liczby są takie same</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>min(coordinates)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Minimum",
            "id": 82908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Znajdź najmniejszą liczbę monet zdobytych w rundzie gry.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"coins = [\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(coins))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"38\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>min(coins)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Maximum",
            "id": 82909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co zostanie wyświetlone w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"password = [\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max(password))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>max(password)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nic</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Maximum",
            "id": 82910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Znajdź największą liczbę kroków wykonanych przez użytkownika.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"steps = [\" /><text value=\"6000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"9000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max(steps))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"43\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"9000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>max(steps)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shares = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max(shares) = most_shares\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Powinno być <code>most_shares = max(shares)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie możemy zapisać największej wartości w zmiennej</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Z kodem wszystko jest w porządku</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Powinno to być <code>shares.max()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Powinno być <code>most_shares = max(shares)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Save in variable",
            "id": 82912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz zmienną <code>highest</code> i przechowaj w niej najwyższą wartość z listy <code>temperatures</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"68\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"81\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = max(temperatures)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(highest)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"55\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"81\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>highest = max(temperatures)</code>.</p></body></html>"
