          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82918,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który fragment kodu pozwala nam sortować listę ciągów znaków alfabetycznie?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>min()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>max()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nie ma takiego kodu</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82919,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dowiedz się, które sklepy mają najlepsze ceny produktu, używając <code>sort()</code> z listą <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"9.7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"prices.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(prices)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"38\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[9.7, 10, 10.8]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>prices.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Display",
            "id": 82920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co zostanie wyświetlone w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_points = [\" /><text value=\"97\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"76\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(test_points)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(test_points)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"test_points.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[97, 76]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[97, 76]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[97, 76]</code>, a następnie <code>[97, 76]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[97, 76]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[97, 76]</code>, a następnie <code>[76, 97]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[76, 97]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[97, 76]</code>, a następnie <code>[97, 76]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
